(4521323, 651117, 89431, '<td valign="top">Love love love the bright vibrant color, not enough pictures are as vibrant. The detail it sharp where it needs to be and you have suceeded in creating movement with the repeation of the pattern of the circle.</td>', 'Love love love the bright vibrant color, not enough pictures are as vibrant. The detail it sharp where it needs to be and you have suceeded in creating movement with the repeation of the pattern of the circle.', '2008-02-27 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521331, 651124, 89431, '<td valign="top">Your subject is boring, you may have been going for abstraction but it doesnt work for me. There is too much negative space and not enough contrast between colors. Maybe a more interesting shape or some kind of line, pattern, or 3D object would have made this work better.</td>', 'Your subject is boring, you may have been going for abstraction but it doesnt work for me. There is too much negative space and not enough contrast between colors. Maybe a more interesting shape or some kind of line, pattern, or 3D object would have made this work better.', '2008-02-27 10:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521335, 650591, 89424, '<td valign="top">The lines of the ice in this photograph lead the viewers eye across the picture. The values in the ice are also capture very well. The extremely laerge border does take alot away fromt he picture.</td>', 'The lines of the ice in this photograph lead the viewers eye across the picture. The values in the ice are also capture very well. The extremely laerge border does take alot away fromt he picture.', '2008-02-27 10:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521344, 651131, 89431, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, vibrant colors. I love the values and the rough texture of your subject. He gets a little blurry but that is to be expected wih how close you were. Really nice shot.</td>', 'Beautiful, vibrant colors. I love the values and the rough texture of your subject. He gets a little blurry but that is to be expected wih how close you were. Really nice shot.', '2008-02-27 10:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
