(4521593, 651795, 66384, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering about the color of this shot -- it seems to be lacking. The tongue doesn''t even have much color on my monitor. Also the crop seems just a little too tight, especially above the head and on the end of the tail. However, it is remarkable how well the dog matches the background.</td>', 'I''m wondering about the color of this shot -- it seems to be lacking. The tongue doesn''t even have much color on my monitor. Also the crop seems just a little too tight, especially above the head and on the end of the tail. However, it is remarkable how well the dog matches the background.', '2008-02-27 11:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4521654, 651129, 66384, '<td valign="top">This image is too small to be able to evaluate it fully. This <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tutorial</a> may help you achieve a good size for the challenges.</td>', 'This image is too small to be able to evaluate it fully. This tutorial may help you achieve a good size for the challenges.', '2008-02-27 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
