(4522193, 650373, 89219, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo could easily have been entered in the B&amp;W in colour challenge. I really like the fact they''re almost perfectly synchronised in the same pose.</td>', 'Fantastic photo could easily have been entered in the B&W in colour challenge. I really like the fact they''re almost perfectly synchronised in the same pose.', '2008-02-27 13:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
