(4522204, 652061, 89219, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the theme, really like the colours and texture. Though I continuously find my eye drawn away from your hand, which I''m not sure is a good thing.</td>', 'Interesting take on the theme, really like the colours and texture. Though I continuously find my eye drawn away from your hand, which I''m not sure is a good thing.', '2008-02-27 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522212, 651084, 89219, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and stunning model. I like the way the shallow depth of field makes her face seemingly grow out of the background.</td>', 'Great portrait and stunning model. I like the way the shallow depth of field makes her face seemingly grow out of the background.', '2008-02-27 13:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522224, 650542, 89219, '<td valign="top">There''s is something very odd about this....I think I like it.<br/>The shapes, texture, expression, contrast all seem really wrong.  The eyes are so white they almost look like goggle eyes. But it kinda works, for me anyway.</td>', 'There''s is something very odd about this....I think I like it.The shapes, texture, expression, contrast all seem really wrong.  The eyes are so white they almost look like goggle eyes. But it kinda works, for me anyway.', '2008-02-27 13:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522246, 651668, 53316, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the title... I needed that right about now.</td>', 'Thanks for the title... I needed that right about now.', '2008-02-27 14:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522257, 652000, 89219, '<td valign="top">I do like these colours together but I don''t think either picture is well enough composed to stand on its own.  <br/>Both the flowers are slightly pointing away from each other which separates the pictures and there''s a little to much headroom for my taste.<br/> <br/>Good detail and depth of field and I think the left colour is really refreshing, I''d have liked to seen more yellow in the background to match.</td>', 'I do like these colours together but I don''t think either picture is well enough composed to stand on its own.  Both the flowers are slightly pointing away from each other which separates the pictures and there''s a little to much headroom for my taste. Good detail and depth of field and I think the left colour is really refreshing, I''d have liked to seen more yellow in the background to match.', '2008-02-27 14:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522269, 651093, 89219, '<td valign="top">Nice pic I''d like to have seen a more pinky background with less blue.</td>', 'Nice pic I''d like to have seen a more pinky background with less blue.', '2008-02-27 14:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522287, 650540, 89219, '<td valign="top">This is a great picture but I''m sure I saw something very similar in the first incarnation of this challenge.</td>', 'This is a great picture but I''m sure I saw something very similar in the first incarnation of this challenge.', '2008-02-27 14:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4522307, 650570, 89219, '<td valign="top">The background is to dark and the colour that is there is too red. Not a bad photo but for me doesn''t fit the challenge.</td>', 'The background is to dark and the colour that is there is too red. Not a bad photo but for me doesn''t fit the challenge.', '2008-02-27 14:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
