(4522365, 650060, 89219, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I do like the echo of the flower I''d have cropped out a lot of the left of the shot as the red plant is distracting.<br/> <br/>Doesn''t meet the challenge though as colours aren''t overlapping.</td>', 'Nice picture, I do like the echo of the flower I''d have cropped out a lot of the left of the shot as the red plant is distracting. Doesn''t meet the challenge though as colours aren''t overlapping.', '2008-02-27 14:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
