(4524251, 651084, 60060, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Can''t fault it. I love the shadows cast by the stems on her face. 10.</td>', 'Lovely shot. Can''t fault it. I love the shadows cast by the stems on her face. 10.', '2008-02-28 05:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524254, 650848, 60060, '<td valign="top">Very nice Idea. nice lighting.</td>', 'Very nice Idea. nice lighting.', '2008-02-28 05:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524261, 651737, 60060, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot. I would possibly have cloned the slight white speck in the pupil out. And there is a slight reflection of the photographer in the pupil as well. Just some things I think could have taken this from a good shot to a great shot. Voted 6.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot. I would possibly have cloned the slight white speck in the pupil out. And there is a slight reflection of the photographer in the pupil as well. Just some things I think could have taken this from a good shot to a great shot. Voted 6.', '2008-02-28 05:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524262, 651167, 60060, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nice use of rule of thirds, and sits nicely on the eye. 7.</td>', 'I like this. Nice use of rule of thirds, and sits nicely on the eye. 7.', '2008-02-28 05:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524268, 649510, 60060, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is the look you were going for, but the flower seems to be mostly out of focus. I think this could have benefited from a lower aperture, increasing the depth of field on the image. I think otherwise, it is a really nice shot. I like the lighting especially.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is the look you were going for, but the flower seems to be mostly out of focus. I think this could have benefited from a lower aperture, increasing the depth of field on the image. I think otherwise, it is a really nice shot. I like the lighting especially.', '2008-02-28 05:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524270, 650839, 60060, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighting.', '2008-02-28 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524272, 652077, 60060, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. I do feel that for the most part it is a littly out of focus though, and could have benefited either from a lower aperture, or some USM in post-edit. Really works wonders. Beautiful shot otherwise though. Nice lighting, beautiful colours. 7.</td>', 'I really like this image. I do feel that for the most part it is a littly out of focus though, and could have benefited either from a lower aperture, or some USM in post-edit. Really works wonders. Beautiful shot otherwise though. Nice lighting, beautiful colours. 7.', '2008-02-28 05:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524276, 651125, 60060, '<td valign="top">I feel this shot doesn''t really work for me, for a few reasons. The green seems to interrupt the flow of the colour on colour, and distracts me from the subject of the image. It looks as though you used a flash for this shot, and this could work if you have the light bouncing off the roof (Flash), or use some other source of lighting, as the direct flash gives some blare off the inside of the lemons. I think whole lemons could also have made the shot slightly more attractive. Hope this helps.</td>', 'I feel this shot doesn''t really work for me, for a few reasons. The green seems to interrupt the flow of the colour on colour, and distracts me from the subject of the image. It looks as though you used a flash for this shot, and this could work if you have the light bouncing off the roof (Flash), or use some other source of lighting, as the direct flash gives some blare off the inside of the lemons. I think whole lemons could also have made the shot slightly more attractive. Hope this helps.', '2008-02-28 05:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524278, 652017, 60060, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Not much more I can say. Great idea.</td>', 'Awesome. Not much more I can say. Great idea.', '2008-02-28 05:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524282, 651634, 60060, '<td valign="top">The flowers are beautiful. I think that a bottom up shot may have been a little easier on the eye for this particular shot. Also, If the flowers had been suspended off the background (I think it''s a towel), the background would have been more out off focus, which would have, IMO, kept my focus on the flowers. I think this shot could have benefited from some other light source. Hope this helps.</td>', 'The flowers are beautiful. I think that a bottom up shot may have been a little easier on the eye for this particular shot. Also, If the flowers had been suspended off the background (I think it''s a towel), the background would have been more out off focus, which would have, IMO, kept my focus on the flowers. I think this shot could have benefited from some other light source. Hope this helps.', '2008-02-28 06:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524285, 651934, 60060, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this shot. The reflections make for a really nice shot, but I feel that had all the balls (I think that''s what they are) been in focus, I would have voted slightly higher. Nice shot otherwise though. Hope this helps.</td>', 'I like the idea of this shot. The reflections make for a really nice shot, but I feel that had all the balls (I think that''s what they are) been in focus, I would have voted slightly higher. Nice shot otherwise though. Hope this helps.', '2008-02-28 06:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524287, 650373, 60060, '<td valign="top">Beautiful action shot. Nice colours. Great.</td>', 'Beautiful action shot. Nice colours. Great.', '2008-02-28 06:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524289, 652046, 60060, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. It looks like you were going for a background with the same pattern of the subject, but I feel a plain BG would have worked a little better here. Also, I feel some other light source would have worked better than the flash here. Hope this helps. 5.</td>', 'Interesting shot. It looks like you were going for a background with the same pattern of the subject, but I feel a plain BG would have worked a little better here. Also, I feel some other light source would have worked better than the flash here. Hope this helps. 5.', '2008-02-28 06:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4524292, 651434, 60060, '<td valign="top">A plain creme bacground would have been perfect here. Still a beautiful shot though. 8.</td>', 'A plain creme bacground would have been perfect here. Still a beautiful shot though. 8.', '2008-02-28 06:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
