(4525262, 652015, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like how you took this in a natural setting.  Much more enjoyable to view than all of the studio setups in this challenge (IMO anyway).<br/> <br/>You made a nice choice with aperture for good DOF and clarity.  The models pose works well also (bet that rock became uncomfortable!).<br/> <br/>Only nit I have is the dark green foliage in the lower left.  I would have considered a little tighter crop on the left or cloning this out.<br/> <br/>Overall, very well done!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like how you took this in a natural setting.  Much more enjoyable to view than all of the studio setups in this challenge (IMO anyway). You made a nice choice with aperture for good DOF and clarity.  The models pose works well also (bet that rock became uncomfortable!). Only nit I have is the dark green foliage in the lower left.  I would have considered a little tighter crop on the left or cloning this out. Overall, very well done!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-28 12:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525270, 651595, 89479, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, i hope it gets a ribbon. great work.<br/>10</td>', 'I love this photo, i hope it gets a ribbon. great work.10', '2008-02-28 12:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
