(4525281, 651672, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image.  Thoughtful, creative, edgy...although it does seem a bit busy for this challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting image.  Thoughtful, creative, edgy...although it does seem a bit busy for this challenge.', '2008-02-28 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525431, 652076, 30049, '<td valign="top">You sure she''s not trying to hide under her leg to look backwards?  Deer can be pretty sneaky at times.  :-)<br/> <br/>Just kidding.<br/> <br/>I considered going after a deer shot with a deer against the tall brown grasses in a local field (usually see numerous deer there at dusk).  Went a different direction in the end.<br/> <br/>The bare tree branches in the background actually work quite well for this.  May be getting some flak for the green with some I imagine.  :-/<br/> <br/>Nice job of getting good detail and clarity.  I was going to say it''s a bit centered but which way do you go to correct it?  In the end some things just work centered, and this is one of those times.  :-)<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You sure she''s not trying to hide under her leg to look backwards?  Deer can be pretty sneaky at times.  :-) Just kidding. I considered going after a deer shot with a deer against the tall brown grasses in a local field (usually see numerous deer there at dusk).  Went a different direction in the end. The bare tree branches in the background actually work quite well for this.  May be getting some flak for the green with some I imagine.  :-/ Nice job of getting good detail and clarity.  I was going to say it''s a bit centered but which way do you go to correct it?  In the end some things just work centered, and this is one of those times.  :-) All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-02-28 14:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4525507, 650839, 70896, '<td valign="top">I think you used a red light to light the flower and the cloth. I wish yu could see the (im guessing) yellow in the center of the flower. It seems too flat to me.</td>', 'I think you used a red light to light the flower and the cloth. I wish yu could see the (im guessing) yellow in the center of the flower. It seems too flat to me.', '2008-02-28 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
