(4526959, 651097, 3554, '<td valign="top">Semper Fi! I am going to graduation at MCRD SD next Friday so this picture was extra special for me. I really like the colors and the dogs head and eyes are wonderfully clear. You captured a great expression as well. <br/> <br/>It might have been a bit better if the hat were on top of his head instead of sagging behind him (or her) but I can imagine that''s tough to do. <br/> <br/>BTW Great looking lab -- I love labs with that classic blocky head. Hope he/she gets a chance to go after some ducks now and then. :)</td>', 'Semper Fi! I am going to graduation at MCRD SD next Friday so this picture was extra special for me. I really like the colors and the dogs head and eyes are wonderfully clear. You captured a great expression as well.  It might have been a bit better if the hat were on top of his head instead of sagging behind him (or her) but I can imagine that''s tough to do.  BTW Great looking lab -- I love labs with that classic blocky head. Hope he/she gets a chance to go after some ducks now and then. :)', '2008-02-29 03:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
