(4527919, 651619, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is way to random and doesn''t really have two or more things with one complementary color up next to eachother. It is also too blurry, backing up and just cropping it down would have been a good idea. I do like how you didnt have alot of negative space and the lighting is good, not flat at all.</td>', 'This is way to random and doesn''t really have two or more things with one complementary color up next to eachother. It is also too blurry, backing up and just cropping it down would have been a good idea. I do like how you didnt have alot of negative space and the lighting is good, not flat at all.', '2008-02-29 11:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527922, 651634, 89774, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice idea, but the lighting seems a little off to me (some over exposed areas and too much shadow) and the towel is a little distracting. You may want to try reshooting next to a window (without any artificial lighting) and if you can, raise the flowers up from the towel so you can blur the background out a little (like it is in the background).</td>', 'This is a really nice idea, but the lighting seems a little off to me (some over exposed areas and too much shadow) and the towel is a little distracting. You may want to try reshooting next to a window (without any artificial lighting) and if you can, raise the flowers up from the towel so you can blur the background out a little (like it is in the background).', '2008-02-29 11:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4527924, 652031, 89431, '<td valign="top">This is very sharp and well done. I like the small line of the cup on the edge of the glass that seperates the two dark colors, that really makes the picture for me as well as the contrasting light bubbles to your overall dark picture. Well done!</td>', 'This is very sharp and well done. I like the small line of the cup on the edge of the glass that seperates the two dark colors, that really makes the picture for me as well as the contrasting light bubbles to your overall dark picture. Well done!', '2008-02-29 11:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
