(4528214, 650060, 30049, '<td valign="top">Not quite getting what you were going for here in the "Color on Color" theme.  ???<br/> <br/>The foreground green leaves (some of them) are in focus, and the front yellow pod is just a tad soft.  From this photo I can''t tell if the white spots on top of the yellow pod are blooms or overexposed highlights.<br/> <br/>I think the "busy-ness" of this image and the mutliple colors in use, are going to dampen your score substantially.  Best of luck to you.</td>', 'Not quite getting what you were going for here in the "Color on Color" theme.  ??? The foreground green leaves (some of them) are in focus, and the front yellow pod is just a tad soft.  From this photo I can''t tell if the white spots on top of the yellow pod are blooms or overexposed highlights. I think the "busy-ness" of this image and the mutliple colors in use, are going to dampen your score substantially.  Best of luck to you.', '2008-02-29 15:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
