(4528849, 651714, 76335, '<td valign="top">Can''t put my finger on it, but I love this. Great colors and textures, and the narrow DOF really works. There are a lot of nice but subtle things here that I''m afraid most voters will miss. A nine for you.</td>', 'Can''t put my finger on it, but I love this. Great colors and textures, and the narrow DOF really works. There are a lot of nice but subtle things here that I''m afraid most voters will miss. A nine for you.', '2008-02-29 22:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
