(4528853, 651619, 90380, '<td valign="top">I apreciate the colourful concept, but it doesn''t quite meet the challenge criteria. That aside, the main technical issue I see with this is that it seems you focused somewhere between the dogs ear and the elephant''s eye, which makes the front guys'' faces just a bit soft. I would try a bit smaller of an aperture to increase dof.</td>', 'I apreciate the colourful concept, but it doesn''t quite meet the challenge criteria. That aside, the main technical issue I see with this is that it seems you focused somewhere between the dogs ear and the elephant''s eye, which makes the front guys'' faces just a bit soft. I would try a bit smaller of an aperture to increase dof.', '2008-02-29 22:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4528854, 651733, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little noisy in the upper left, but still very nice. An eight for you.</td>', 'A little noisy in the upper left, but still very nice. An eight for you.', '2008-02-29 22:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
