(4530431, 650670, 90380, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject, how sharp it is, and the dof. I kiiinda wish the background was a little less pink-y, but I understand it in the context of the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the subject, how sharp it is, and the dof. I kiiinda wish the background was a little less pink-y, but I understand it in the context of the challenge.', '2008-03-01 12:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4530440, 650372, 90380, '<td valign="top">The colour is very soothing and pleasing to the eye. The thing I find a wee bit distracting is the what looks like noise in some parts of the flower and stem. Correct me if I''m wrong. Over-all it''s a very nice photo, and I could be wrong about the noise so I won''t penalize you for it.</td>', 'The colour is very soothing and pleasing to the eye. The thing I find a wee bit distracting is the what looks like noise in some parts of the flower and stem. Correct me if I''m wrong. Over-all it''s a very nice photo, and I could be wrong about the noise so I won''t penalize you for it.', '2008-03-01 12:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
