(4537882, 652047, 811, '<td valign="top">Good still life.  I''m wondering if a tighter crop would make it more effective.</td>', 'Good still life.  I''m wondering if a tighter crop would make it more effective.', '2008-03-04 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4537892, 651557, 90113, '<td valign="top">I voted this kinda'' low for a few reasons.  First, the challenge was to photograph something against the same color background.  The shot doesn''t really have an object in the foreground.  Second, it''s out of focus.  And third, there is a lot of noise in the sky.  Using a tripod might help with the blur.  I have noise issues in low light with my camera too -- but there is a lot you can do with various software programs to help fix that.</td>', 'I voted this kinda'' low for a few reasons.  First, the challenge was to photograph something against the same color background.  The shot doesn''t really have an object in the foreground.  Second, it''s out of focus.  And third, there is a lot of noise in the sky.  Using a tripod might help with the blur.  I have noise issues in low light with my camera too -- but there is a lot you can do with various software programs to help fix that.', '2008-03-04 15:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4537893, 651599, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the subtley of this one.</td>', 'I like the subtley of this one.', '2008-03-04 15:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4537910, 650545, 811, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I think a couple of things could be done to make this a superb image.  First, it is a bit out of focus.  A sharp focus would really help the edges of the candy and the texture of the background set up a nice contrast with each other.  Also, it seems a bit grainy and flat.  It almost looks like it was underexposed and "corrected" in post processing, which introduced the grain.  Also, a bit more contrast would really help it to "pop" as well.</td>', 'Great idea.  I think a couple of things could be done to make this a superb image.  First, it is a bit out of focus.  A sharp focus would really help the edges of the candy and the texture of the background set up a nice contrast with each other.  Also, it seems a bit grainy and flat.  It almost looks like it was underexposed and "corrected" in post processing, which introduced the grain.  Also, a bit more contrast would really help it to "pop" as well.', '2008-03-04 15:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
