(4538385, 650092, 19780, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get a pop of focus for the subject. I think the idea of the depth of field is nice, but just didn''t quite come together to form a good composition.</td>', 'I didn''t get a pop of focus for the subject. I think the idea of the depth of field is nice, but just didn''t quite come together to form a good composition.', '2008-03-04 19:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538387, 651424, 19780, '<td valign="top">I wish the nose was in the image, or a tighter crop around the front leg &amp; elbow where the focus &amp; texture is its best to create a more compelling composition.</td>', 'I wish the nose was in the image, or a tighter crop around the front leg & elbow where the focus & texture is its best to create a more compelling composition.', '2008-03-04 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538388, 650060, 19780, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice, but the composition doesn''t really give me much focus.</td>', 'The colors are nice, but the composition doesn''t really give me much focus.', '2008-03-04 19:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538390, 651619, 19780, '<td valign="top">The focus could be a little sharper. The color depth on some portions (the elephant''s snout) are a little too shallow so much of the detail and wimsy is lost.</td>', 'The focus could be a little sharper. The color depth on some portions (the elephant''s snout) are a little too shallow so much of the detail and wimsy is lost.', '2008-03-04 19:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538392, 652068, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like the red pepper shots.  Pretty good lighting.  I wish you''d cloned the small imperfections on the pepper.</td>', 'I like the red pepper shots.  Pretty good lighting.  I wish you''d cloned the small imperfections on the pepper.', '2008-03-04 19:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538393, 651715, 19780, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the bike in clearer focus and shown completely (the wheels are cut off).</td>', 'I''d like to see the bike in clearer focus and shown completely (the wheels are cut off).', '2008-03-04 19:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538394, 650545, 19780, '<td valign="top">Too blurry and muddled but a fun idea.</td>', 'Too blurry and muddled but a fun idea.', '2008-03-04 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538397, 649093, 19780, '<td valign="top">A nice observation on the relation of the colors. I wish the head wasn''t in shadow (or even the head lifted up a bit, but I''m sure he wasn''t exactly cooperative).</td>', 'A nice observation on the relation of the colors. I wish the head wasn''t in shadow (or even the head lifted up a bit, but I''m sure he wasn''t exactly cooperative).', '2008-03-04 19:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538402, 649230, 58452, '<td valign="top">I think the composition could be stronger, but I really like the shiny copper on copper color scheme.  Nice.</td>', 'I think the composition could be stronger, but I really like the shiny copper on copper color scheme.  Nice.', '2008-03-04 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538404, 651557, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a nice image and rated it as such, but it could be sharper and fit the challenge better.</td>', 'I think it''s a nice image and rated it as such, but it could be sharper and fit the challenge better.', '2008-03-04 19:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538407, 650839, 19780, '<td valign="top">The sharp shadows and contrast are nicely done. The folds of the fabric aid the composition quite a bit.</td>', 'The sharp shadows and contrast are nicely done. The folds of the fabric aid the composition quite a bit.', '2008-03-04 19:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538408, 649510, 19780, '<td valign="top">A little too fuzzy for me and the composition is lacking some oomph. (One of the petals is cropped at the top, either crop the flower to aid the composition or include it in total.)</td>', 'A little too fuzzy for me and the composition is lacking some oomph. (One of the petals is cropped at the top, either crop the flower to aid the composition or include it in total.)', '2008-03-04 19:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538411, 650048, 19780, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a great moment here. I''m missing a lot of the texture and details, I don''t know if it''s the processing but it feels over-blurred.</td>', 'You''ve captured a great moment here. I''m missing a lot of the texture and details, I don''t know if it''s the processing but it feels over-blurred.', '2008-03-04 19:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538413, 651595, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and I love the colors and OOF forms. Maybe a crop just below the two petals and the top and from the bottom just to the edge of the first petal. But that''s totally subjective. Very nice image. Congrats.</td>', 'Nice DOF and I love the colors and OOF forms. Maybe a crop just below the two petals and the top and from the bottom just to the edge of the first petal. But that''s totally subjective. Very nice image. Congrats.', '2008-03-04 19:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538414, 651535, 19780, '<td valign="top">I know it must feel kind of daunting to see so many tomato shots in this challenge and wonder how you''ll measure up. The negative space isn''t working for me here, I just didn''t know what to focus on. The top isn''t quite crisp and the depth of field isn''t helping me to find the composition.</td>', 'I know it must feel kind of daunting to see so many tomato shots in this challenge and wonder how you''ll measure up. The negative space isn''t working for me here, I just didn''t know what to focus on. The top isn''t quite crisp and the depth of field isn''t helping me to find the composition.', '2008-03-04 19:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538415, 651185, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the color gradation of you background a lot.</td>', 'I like the color gradation of you background a lot.', '2008-03-04 19:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538416, 652026, 58452, '<td valign="top">For me only the shadow of the glass intrudes on this composition. The interaction of the waves with the shapes of the cherries is nice. Maybe an optical illusion but glass seems to be slightly to the right. If you''re gonna center something, hit the mark. Just a nit pic. Nice image.</td>', 'For me only the shadow of the glass intrudes on this composition. The interaction of the waves with the shapes of the cherries is nice. Maybe an optical illusion but glass seems to be slightly to the right. If you''re gonna center something, hit the mark. Just a nit pic. Nice image.', '2008-03-04 19:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538441, 650241, 58452, '<td valign="top">I like this composition a lot. I think maybe cropping down from the top to the first bright layer might be better.  The dark band above seems to draw my eye out of the frame.  Just a nit pic though. I don''t know how you got that appearance of the water while still maintaining a fairly clear and sharp subject.  But I love it.  Congrats.</td>', 'I like this composition a lot. I think maybe cropping down from the top to the first bright layer might be better.  The dark band above seems to draw my eye out of the frame.  Just a nit pic though. I don''t know how you got that appearance of the water while still maintaining a fairly clear and sharp subject.  But I love it.  Congrats.', '2008-03-04 20:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
