(4538482, 651129, 70107, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is getting a 2 from me.<br/>This picture is too small, you should check out the advanced editing rules, your picture can be up to 720 pixels, and 200 000 KB.<br/> <br/>and this does not fit the challenge,<br/>It is not completely out of focus, so I gave you another point</td>', 'Sorry but this is getting a 2 from me.This picture is too small, you should check out the advanced editing rules, your picture can be up to 720 pixels, and 200 000 KB. and this does not fit the challenge,It is not completely out of focus, so I gave you another point', '2008-03-04 20:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
