(4538491, 651749, 39349, '<td valign="top">Very nice setup here. I like the back lighting you''ve used here my only one suggestion would have been to bounce just a little bit into the center of the flower to light up. Nothing to knock points off for. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice setup here. I like the back lighting you''ve used here my only one suggestion would have been to bounce just a little bit into the center of the flower to light up. Nothing to knock points off for. Well done.', '2008-03-04 20:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538499, 650059, 39349, '<td valign="top">I really like your composition here and lighting. My only suggestion would be to have stopped down a full stop or two to get the whole pepper in focus. Other than that nice work!</td>', 'I really like your composition here and lighting. My only suggestion would be to have stopped down a full stop or two to get the whole pepper in focus. Other than that nice work!', '2008-03-04 20:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538513, 650819, 39349, '<td valign="top">Your idea is wonderful and I''m sure this is an emotionally important photograph to you, but let me tell you how I think this could be better.<br/> <br/>First when you shoot this type of shot less is more. By that I mean we need to simplify the shot as much as possible. I think we could have improved this more by losing the distracting background and shooting this against a neutral backdrop like black, white or even gray.<br/> <br/>Second, we have way too many fingers competing for attention here. I would suggest only two hands the adult hand cradling the younger one would add a ton of beautiful emotion to this shot. You could shoot it from many different angels and not go wrong. <br/> <br/>Finally, the lighting is really harsh on the right side of the frame. Toning that down by defusing it would really help out.<br/> <br/>Great idea and good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Your idea is wonderful and I''m sure this is an emotionally important photograph to you, but let me tell you how I think this could be better. First when you shoot this type of shot less is more. By that I mean we need to simplify the shot as much as possible. I think we could have improved this more by losing the distracting background and shooting this against a neutral backdrop like black, white or even gray. Second, we have way too many fingers competing for attention here. I would suggest only two hands the adult hand cradling the younger one would add a ton of beautiful emotion to this shot. You could shoot it from many different angels and not go wrong.  Finally, the lighting is really harsh on the right side of the frame. Toning that down by defusing it would really help out. Great idea and good luck with the challenge.', '2008-03-04 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538515, 651381, 39349, '<td valign="top">As a matter of fact I am, nice macro work.</td>', 'As a matter of fact I am, nice macro work.', '2008-03-04 20:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538520, 650064, 39349, '<td valign="top">Little too flat, try bumping up the contrast. It will really make this shot pop. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Little too flat, try bumping up the contrast. It will really make this shot pop. Good luck with the challenge.', '2008-03-04 20:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538524, 650644, 39349, '<td valign="top">Interesting for sure, the smoke is really competing for attention here IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting for sure, the smoke is really competing for attention here IMHO.', '2008-03-04 20:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538542, 651787, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, DOF and composition. Nice work!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, DOF and composition. Nice work!', '2008-03-04 20:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538553, 652015, 39349, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the centered composition here. I would suggest cropping in closer on the model to get her head and torso on the left up and lower third lines. I think you could improve this shot with a bit more contrast as well, it seems a bit flat to me.<br/> <br/>I do however really like your choice of DOF and exposure control is spot on. Good luck with the challenge. 8</td>', 'Not sure about the centered composition here. I would suggest cropping in closer on the model to get her head and torso on the left up and lower third lines. I think you could improve this shot with a bit more contrast as well, it seems a bit flat to me. I do however really like your choice of DOF and exposure control is spot on. Good luck with the challenge. 8', '2008-03-04 20:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538557, 651932, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! I would only suggest cropping in on both of the faces to eliminate the ground under and over their heads. There is so much wonderful texture in the fir just begging to be seen. 8</td>', 'Nice capture! I would only suggest cropping in on both of the faces to eliminate the ground under and over their heads. There is so much wonderful texture in the fir just begging to be seen. 8', '2008-03-04 20:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538572, 651722, 39349, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure what the relationship between the tomato and the sucker are but I''m thinking that you should lose one or the other, they seem to be competing for the others attention. <br/> <br/>Your lighting is on the money as well as your DOF. 7</td>', 'I''m really not sure what the relationship between the tomato and the sucker are but I''m thinking that you should lose one or the other, they seem to be competing for the others attention.  Your lighting is on the money as well as your DOF. 7', '2008-03-04 21:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4538580, 651131, 39349, '<td valign="top">Ladies and Gentlemen we have the winner. Nothing I can say about this to improve it so I''ll just hit the 10. <br/> <br/>Beautiful work and the textures are just amazing! I fell like I could touch this little guy (or I suppose it could be a gal) and he (or she) would flinch!</td>', 'Ladies and Gentlemen we have the winner. Nothing I can say about this to improve it so I''ll just hit the 10.  Beautiful work and the textures are just amazing! I fell like I could touch this little guy (or I suppose it could be a gal) and he (or she) would flinch!', '2008-03-04 21:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
