(4552338, 652045, 67697, '<td valign="top">lol, I just sent an email.  Not only was it a 6+ photo but it''s also your new personal best!  Look at you!  That is awesome.  I love the beautiful golds and browns in this.  I see that you are able to combine your painting skills with photography now.  Keep it up and who knows down what path this will lead you :)</td>', 'lol, I just sent an email.  Not only was it a 6+ photo but it''s also your new personal best!  Look at you!  That is awesome.  I love the beautiful golds and browns in this.  I see that you are able to combine your painting skills with photography now.  Keep it up and who knows down what path this will lead you :)', '2008-03-10 13:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4552895, 651673, 90495, '<td valign="top">I thought this was gorgeous. I kept coming back to this one but I never managed to leave a comment. I figured it would do well so why comment on a 9. Great comp and the greens look fabulous.</td>', 'I thought this was gorgeous. I kept coming back to this one but I never managed to leave a comment. I figured it would do well so why comment on a 9. Great comp and the greens look fabulous.', '2008-03-10 17:02:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4554087, 651673, 89940, '<td valign="top">Since you asked why your color on color did not resonate so well with folks I thought I would share my thoughts. <br/> <br/>The color of the apple and the background are too close together. There is no real delineation. Seeing the original RAW conversion I can see that the beads are providing that delineation but it wasn''t clear from the submitted photo. Also the background is a little too busy and draws my eye away from the foreground objects. <br/> <br/>During voting I gave it a 5. Hope this is helpful.</td>', 'Since you asked why your color on color did not resonate so well with folks I thought I would share my thoughts.  The color of the apple and the background are too close together. There is no real delineation. Seeing the original RAW conversion I can see that the beads are providing that delineation but it wasn''t clear from the submitted photo. Also the background is a little too busy and draws my eye away from the foreground objects.  During voting I gave it a 5. Hope this is helpful.', '2008-03-11 01:40:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4554873, 651673, 67697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Moose408:</b></div><hr/><i> ...The color of the apple and the background are too close together. There is no real delineation. Seeing the original RAW conversion I can see that the beads are providing that delineation but it wasn''t clear from the submitted photo. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I do appreciate the feedback as it always helps to hear what others see ;)<br/> <br/>I looked at this description:  <i>Take a picture of a colored subject or subjects on the same color background</i>  and went with the thought of the subject and background must match as closely as possible.  And I think I achieved that.  I guess it would be interesting to see how this would have done WITHOUT the beads.  Live and learn.  :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for the honest feedback!</td>', 'Originally posted by Moose408: ...The color of the apple and the background are too close together. There is no real delineation. Seeing the original RAW conversion I can see that the beads are providing that delineation but it wasn''t clear from the submitted photo.   I do appreciate the feedback as it always helps to hear what others see ;) I looked at this description:  Take a picture of a colored subject or subjects on the same color background  and went with the thought of the subject and background must match as closely as possible.  And I think I achieved that.  I guess it would be interesting to see how this would have done WITHOUT the beads.  Live and learn.  :) Thanks for the honest feedback!', '2008-03-11 12:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
